启动 ros2 launch sx_start sx_start.py

开始比赛ros2 service call red_standard_robot1/start_match std_srvs/srv/SetBool "{data: true}"

依赖完整性检查rosdep install -r --from-paths src --ignore-src --rosdistro $ROS_DISTRO -y

构建功能包colcon build --symlink-install --cmake-args -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release

*仿真启动（调试）ros2 launch rmu_gazebo_simulator bringup_sim.launch.py

*导航启动（调试）ros2 launch nav_bringup rm_navigation_reality_launch.py
                ros2 launch nav_bringup rm_navigation_simulation_launch.py
                
*新建功能ros2 pkg create bramble_costmap --build-type ament_cmake --dependencies rclcpp --license Apache-2.0

*rqt查看rqt --ros-args -r __ns:=/red_standard_robot1 -r /tf:=/red_standard_robot1/tf -r /tf_static:=/red_standard_robot1/tf_static -p qos_profile_reliability:=reliable -p qos_profile_durability:=volatile

参数设置位置：
    启动参数：Decision_tree/sx_start/config
    导航参数：Path_Navigation/nav_bringup/config.
    保存地图：ros2 run nav2_map_server map_saver_cli -f <YOUR_MAP_NAME>  --ros-args -r __ns:=/red_standard_robot1
